● .argonauts/config.local.toml needs a fix before you can trust it: checks.run
  can't be a list of strings; it takes a list of checks, each a [[checks.run]]
  table with a name and a command. Write it like this:
  [[checks.run]]
  name = "python3"
  command = ["python3", "-m", "unittest", "-q"]
